              4 AWG drop = 2 × 12.9 × 100 × 150 ÷ 41,740 = 9.27 V =
              <span class="font-bold text-rose-700">3.86% ✗</span><br />
              3 AWG = 7.36 V = 3.06% ✗ · 2 AWG = 5.83 V = 2.43% ✓<br />
